A cleanliness class and a product result (@cm-class: 0, is #chapter, #part-of @clean-manufacturing, #source "../sources/Cleanroom-Programming-and-Energy-LBNL.lingua#r_36R5RS6HEWBTYN4SHCVPQNP12X", #source "../sources/Contamination-Control-Engineering-NASA.lingua#r_2XKKPYTW2DPQPQZ8VPV23BJ8A5", #source "../sources/Sterile-Products-WHO.lingua#r_6BVEG1GSVGGGD566CJKD254DSB", #clean-manufacturing "Time-place-and-operating-state-belong-with-the-result.lingua#r_5DS9CBQ5QH29YYFY9M4P13H9E1") { r_0P5SA7T7W35B8MSEHGEYQQ87WY
**Read:** [Cleanroom programming and energy — Tschudi, Sartor and Xu](../sources/Cleanroom-Programming-and-Energy-LBNL.lingua#r_36R5RS6HEWBTYN4SHCVPQNP12X), requirements; [Contamination control engineering — Tribble and colleagues, NASA CR 4740](../sources/Contamination-Control-Engineering-NASA.lingua#r_2XKKPYTW2DPQPQZ8VPV23BJ8A5), historical classifications; [Sterile pharmaceutical products — WHO TRS 1044, Annex 2](../sources/Sterile-Products-WHO.lingua#r_6BVEG1GSVGGGD566CJKD254DSB), premises and monitoring.

A class summarizes specified observations under a defined convention. It does not replace the product's requirement, establish every contaminant's identity or describe every operating state. State the standard edition, particle-size convention, sampling conditions and whether the process is operating before comparing labels.

Historical reports may use superseded standards. Their measurements and physical reasoning can still be studied, while an application needs the relevant current specification. Avoid silently translating a label into a different system without checking definitions.

**Work:** Read one historical class description and one applicable modern source obtained through an authorized channel. Compare what each actually measures. Explain how a room could meet the stated observation while a local handling operation still contaminates a sensitive surface.

**Return:** [Clean manufacturing and contamination control](../Clean-manufacturing-and-contamination-control.lingua#r_7D8SQ8BVQDZQBDBGC6DP0JAMZN).
**Continue in clean manufacturing:** [Time, place and operating state belong with the result](Time-place-and-operating-state-belong-with-the-result.lingua#r_5DS9CBQ5QH29YYFY9M4P13H9E1).

